      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "BBC News reports that Trump greeted 'my friend' Putin as the pair shook hands.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:05a593c347cf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "Vladimir Vladimirovich Putin, born 7 October 1952, is a Russian politician and former intelligence officer who has served as President of Russia since 2012, having previously served from 1999 to 2008.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386716440:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "Putin was born on 7 October 1952 at the V.F. Snegiryov Maternity Hospital No.6 in Saint Petersburg.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q7747:P569",
        "wd:Q7747:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "Wikidata records that he was educated at the Academy of the Federal Security Service of the Russian Federation, the Academy of Foreign Intelligence, Saint Petersburg Mining University and 5 more institutions.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q7747:P69:Q2387574",
