        "wd:Q7747:P69:Q4534839"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "His recorded work includes the KGB, the First Chief Directorate, the Presidential Administration of Russia and the Administrative Directorate of the President, in Moscow, Saint Petersburg and Dresden.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q7747:P108:Q80919",
        "wd:Q7747:P108:Q2031025",
        "wd:Q7747:P108:Q4476368",
        "wd:Q7747:P108:Q2060629",
