      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:42Z",
      "text": "Wikidata lists 76 awards on record, among them Time 100 (2022) and Order of Kim Il Sung (2024).",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q7747:P166:Q512656"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-19T00:00:48Z",
      "text": "Known works listed include A Plea for Caution From Russia, Russia at the Turn of the Millennium and Russia Muscles Up — the Challenges We Must Rise to Face.",
